<title>TURKEY: Bosphorus closed to two-way traffic on Friday.</title>
<headline>Bosphorus closed to two-way traffic on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Istanbul's Bosphorus Strait will be closed to two-way sea traffic between 2:00 and 5:00 p.m. (1100-1400 GMT) on Friday due to Turkish national holiday celebrations, maritime officials said.</p>
<p>They said navy ships would hold a parade on the Straits during that time to mark the 74th anniversary of the Turkish Victory day.</p>
<p>-- Istanbul Newsroom, +90-212-275 0875</p>
